# Template for your secrets file. Names only, never values.
#
# 1. Copy it:   Copy-Item env.example .env      (PowerShell, in the samsulek folder)
# 2. Open .env with Notepad and fill in values YOURSELF.
# 3. Never commit .env, never paste its contents anywhere, including any chat.
#
# Lines are NAME=value, no spaces around "=". Lines starting with # are ignored.

# --- Milestone M5: paper trading on the Trading 212 DEMO account ---
T212_DEMO_API_KEY=
T212_DEMO_API_SECRET=
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# --- Milestone M6: live trading. Do NOT fill these in before the go-live checklist is signed. ---
# Variables containing _LIVE_ are only loaded when the bot runs in live mode.
# T212_LIVE_API_KEY=
# T212_LIVE_API_SECRET=

# LIVE is never read from this file. It must be set in the terminal for a live session only.
